    'Ves smiled goofily, waving the flagon of ale in her hand.'
    VES @smile_talk 'I made my own!'
    VES @lewd_talk 'But I think I made it too strong because...'
    VES @lewd_talk '{i}*Hiccup!*{/i}'
    VES @lewd_talk '... Mmm... Y-Yep...'
